<title>JAPAN: CRC Research - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>CRC Research - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.87		vs	    9.68</p>
<p> Operating   loss 107 million	 vs    loss 17 million</p>
<p> Current	loss 83 million	 vs    loss 15 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 103 million	 vs   loss 356 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 5.92 yen	  vs    loss 23.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     18 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - CRC Research Institute Inc is a general research firm involved in dataprocessing, system integration and consulting.</p>
